# .NET build and test output
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
**/coverage/

# Emulator runtimes, ROMs, saves, and save states must stay local
**/Runtime/
**/*.nds
**/*.sav
**/*.save
**/*.ml[0-9]
**/*.dsv
**/*.rom

# The parent Unity .gitignore excludes generated project files globally.
!*.csproj
!*.sln
!*.slnx
